Package: cix-libdrm
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: CIX DRM userspace library and diagnostics
 This package provides the CIX DRM extension library, the private CIX libdrm
 build, and DRM diagnostic programs used by CIX platform software.

Package: cix-libdrm-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 cix-libdrm (= ${binary:Version}),
 libdrm-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: development files for the CIX DRM userspace library
 This package provides the CIX DRM headers, unversioned linker names, and
 pkg-config metadata required to build CIX platform software.
